ne over the past 6 months","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Cybersecurity liability and talent cost inflation \u2014 a single breach can erase years of goodwill, and the war for engineering talent compresses margins even at scale.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Operating margins 9% above sector median \u2014 the quantitative trace of pricing power","Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount","Altman Z comfortably in the safe zone \u2014 a fortress balance sheet on this measure","17 consecutive years of dividend payments \u2014 an operating record that makes the dividend claim credible","Healthy payout ratio leaves room for both dividend growth and reinvestment"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"ESCO (ESE) Q4 2026 Earnings Call Transcript","source":"aol.com","link":"https://www.aol.com/articles/esco-ese-q4-2026-earnings-154506000.html","date":"2026-11-20","timestamp":1795189815.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"ESCO Technologies Inc. (NYSE:ESE) Stock to Pay Quarterly Dividend of $0.08","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/20/esco-technologies-inc-nyseese-stock-to-pay-quarterly-dividend-of-0-08.html","date":"2026-11-20","timestamp":1795183374.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.625,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings","dividend"]},{"title":"ESCO Technologies Inc (ESE) (Q4 2026) Earnings Call Highlights: Record Orders, Strong Cash ...","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/esco-technologies-inc-ese-q4-050050506.html","date":"2026-11-20","timestamp":1795150850.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.852,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"ESCO Technologies declares $0.08 dividend","source":"seekingalpha.com","link":"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4675038-esco-technologies-declares-008-dividend","date":"2026-11-20","timest